BT 59.53 618.50 Td (Services: Cloud payroll processing; Employee records and leave management; Payslip) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (delivery portal.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (Hosting: Stratus Cloud, Frankfurt region.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 540.54 Td (Data handled: employee and customer contact records; bank account and payment details.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 509.36 Td (Key suppliers: Stratus Cloud \(hosting\); Mailwave \(transactional email\); Payrail Gateway) Tj ET
BT 59.53 493.77 Td (\(payment file transfer\).) Tj ET
