BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 5: Resilience) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (Customers can follow the service status on a public page.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (A documented incident response plan defines roles and severity levels, and a tabletop) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (exercise tests it every year.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (The company will notify customers through an incident notification within 72 hours, and) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (affected customers receive regular updates.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 618.50 Td (Business continuity and disaster recovery plans set an RTO of four hours and an RPO of) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (one hour, and are tested every year.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (Offices have fire exits, evacuation signs and first-aid kits on every floor.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 247.18 33.03 Td (Nimbara HR - Page 6 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

